-Sessions never expire.
+## Session expiry
+
+`save_session` records an `issued_at` timestamp, and `encode_blob` stamps one into each resume
+blob. `load_session` rejects a session older than `SESSION_TTL` (3600 seconds) with
+`SessionExpiredError`, and also calls `purge_expired()`, which deletes expired entries from the
+on-disk cache.
+
+Resume blobs are JSON signed with HMAC-SHA256 using the `SESSION_SECRET` environment variable
+(required), so a client cannot alter `issued_at`. Pickle blobs are no longer accepted.
